<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="fc8f89f6">&lt;p&gt;
    Plan to conduct this exercise only once all sprints have concluded and both the client and EY are in agreement that the
    project has come to a close.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Submit all documentation including the final product increment developed and the resulting Product Backlog to client
    stakeholders for final review and sign-off. Provide any further explanations necessary for work not completed, as there
    should already be a general agreement on the current status of the Product Backlog as a result of sprint review
    discussions.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Perform any necessary close activities to conclude the project and then release all team members making them available
    to pursue other endeavors.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
