<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="5e217a4c"></attribute>
<attribute name="purpose" nodeId="722f7b47">To officially confirm the work delivered, or for acceptable reasons&amp;nbsp;any work that was not delivered,&amp;nbsp;satisifies
the original agreements outlined at the start and conclude the project.</attribute>
